From 3232e1dacdeb580a10a9cb8d4756a4518a7bd83e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: geocausa <geocausa@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: qcom: SP11 AudioReach and WSA884x speaker protection port

Port active speaker protection from geocausa/SP11X1e-audio (commit 3232e1dacdeb)
onto Linux kernel base with camera support for Microsoft Surface Pro 11 (Denali).

Includes:
- SoundWire bus, stream, and Qualcomm SoundWire controller updates
- WSA884x speaker amplifier driver with VI and CPS protection feedback
- AudioReach / q6apm DSP graph configuration for pull-mode and calibration
- LPASS WSA/VA/TX codec macro support and DMIC clock configuration
- Sound card machine driver updates for X1E80100

Attribution: geocausa/SP11X1e-audio
License: GPL-2.0-only / BSD-2-Clause
